# Verify frontend before push

Before `git push`, run the same frontend checks Docker/CI uses. Do not push if they fail.

From `frontend/`:

```bash
npm run validate && npm run build
```

`validate` is `eslint` + `tsc --noEmit`. The image build runs `npm run validate && npm run build` (see `Dockerfile`).

If those commands fail, fix the errors, re-run until they pass, then push. Do not skip this because the change looks small or is not a `.tsx` file you edited this turn — any push can include frontend that CI will compile.
